# Architecture — defect-rate-ia

**Canonical spec:** [CLAUDE.md](../../CLAUDE.md)  
Overview: [docs/architecture.md](../../docs/architecture.md) · Reference: [docs/architecture-reference.md](../../docs/architecture-reference.md)

## Layers

| Layer | Path | Responsibility |
|-------|------|----------------|
| Smart | `app/**/page.tsx` | Hooks + dumb components; no direct HTTP |
| Hooks | `hooks/use*.ts` | State, effects, handlers |
| Services | `services/*.service.ts` | **axios** only |
| Dumb | `components/{atoms,molecules,organisms,templates}/` | UI via props; import down only |
| Providers | `providers/` | QueryProvider (not atomic UI) |
| Lib | `lib/` | Types, pure logic, no I/O |

## Required

- Barrel imports: `@/components`, `@/hooks`, `@/services`
- Design tokens: `styles/primitives/colors.css` + `styles/utilities.css` — no arbitrary Tailwind `[]` or inline UI colors
- Merge classes: `cn` from `@/styles` — never `` `utility ${className}` ``
- Exact deps: `pnpm add --save-exact package@version`
- **No comments** in `.ts` / `.tsx` / `.css` we maintain (see CLAUDE.md)

## Avoid

- `fetch` in pages/hooks → use services
- Domain state in dumb components → use hooks
- Duplicated inline UI (e.g. Skeleton) → shared component
- Organism → organism imports → use template or page composition
- API errors inline → `RequestErrorState` + `btn-retry`

Full detail: **CLAUDE.md** (Atomic components section).
